di/media/images/dw/20260619/1144691336881246208190475.jpeg/ce3blIQBauwGRCAxTkwK7Pytiq428hh-c1otJVZaLSU\"/><figcaption>下午兩時多，橋咀島只有約100名遊人。（鄧倩螢攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"下午兩時多，橋咀島只有約100名遊人。（鄧倩螢攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260619/1144691339733504000627930.jpeg/Y8MyHF_StII5QX2RZAxGdooZco98kxmlMABJwRUAScE\"/><figcaption>下午兩時多，橋咀島只有約100名遊人。（鄧倩螢攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"下午兩時多，橋咀島只有約100名遊人。（鄧倩螢攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260619/1144691321231904768924570.jpeg/yaO4AhTWm2MLabUSxpCMFzz_e2CTXEl6yKTjMO2k4zA\"/><figcaption>下午兩時多，橋咀島只有約100名遊人。（鄧倩螢攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"下午兩時多，橋咀島只有約100名遊人。（鄧倩螢攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260619/1144691324813971456315426.jpeg/YISPDQiUTiYstiFgN7QuTcEIVa292uVkonAW94dwFvc\"/><figcaption>下午兩時多，橋咀島只有約100名遊人。（鄧倩螢攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"下午兩時多，橋咀島只有約100名遊人。（鄧倩螢攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260619/1144691328496701440703916.jpeg/g8ZLG7FTGQJ_kSgRtFdq8Hx3UQ0xpmoaqbl4kIy5eJA\"/><figcaption>下午兩時多，橋咀島只有約100名遊人。（鄧倩螢攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-19T09:58:45.250569+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1452,"images":26,"source":"HK01 社會","fallback":"none"}}